1
00:00:01,835 --> 00:00:02,835
Hello?

2
00:00:03,795 --> 00:00:05,005
I miss you more

3
00:00:08,634 --> 00:00:10,034
Do you have a schedule
for tomorrow?

4
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:13,512
No, I don't

5
00:00:15,349 --> 00:00:16,709
I'll pick you up
at your place then

6
00:00:18,894 --> 00:00:19,937
Okay

7
00:00:20,062 --> 00:00:21,504
I gotta go now

8
00:00:21,588 --> 00:00:22,588
Talk to you later

9
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:25,775
Okay

10
00:00:41,625 --> 00:00:43,085
This is the place

11
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:44,210
Is it?

12
00:00:45,504 --> 00:00:46,504
Gosh, it's been a while

13
00:00:48,215 --> 00:00:50,842
It's not crowded
on weekdays, I guess

14
00:00:50,968 --> 00:00:51,760
Did you come here often?

15
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:53,182
Yeah, a few times

16
00:00:53,266 --> 00:00:54,846
Our practice room
was around here

17
00:00:54,972 --> 00:00:56,640
You wanna try that?

18
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:57,808
That one?

19
00:00:57,933 --> 00:00:59,434
Yeah, I'm good at that

20
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:05,315
Are you afraid
you can't beat me?

21
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:09,110
Let's do it

22
00:01:11,697 --> 00:01:13,031
Hyesung

23
00:01:13,156 --> 00:01:14,574
Were you good
at PE in school?

24
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:16,201
Yeah, I was quite good

25
00:01:16,326 --> 00:01:17,369
How about you?

26
00:01:17,494 --> 00:01:19,579
I was also good

27
00:01:19,705 --> 00:01:22,582
I think I worked hard
until middle school

28
00:01:22,708 --> 00:01:24,038
It might be a shame that

29
00:01:24,121 --> 00:01:25,794
you were too busy
to enjoy a school life

30
00:01:25,919 --> 00:01:27,963
Well… not really

31
00:01:28,088 --> 00:01:29,464
I rather wanted
to make money first

32
00:01:30,841 --> 00:01:32,009
What for?

33
00:01:32,134 --> 00:01:33,302
My grandma was sick

34
00:01:34,303 --> 00:01:36,346
You were quite close
to your grandma, I guess

35
00:01:36,471 --> 00:01:37,973
Yes

36
00:01:38,098 --> 00:01:41,143
Since she passed away
I've been always lonely

37
00:01:44,730 --> 00:01:45,730
What about now?

38
00:01:50,402 --> 00:01:51,570
Are you still lonely?
